WEBVTT

00:00:05.902 --> 00:00:08.905
[all groaning]

00:00:11.298 --> 00:00:12.387
EEP:
Mm?

00:00:12.561 --> 00:00:15.346
[stomachs growling]

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.262
[panting]:
So... hungry.

00:00:18.436 --> 00:00:19.481
[laughs]

00:00:19.655 --> 00:00:21.657
-[screeching]
-[yelling]

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:26.052
I still would've eaten that.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:28.228
All right, pack,
nothing has tried to kill us

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.796
in the last ten minutes,
so let's camp here.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:33.582
Gran and Thunk,
you find us a place to sleep.

00:00:33.756 --> 00:00:35.061
-Here.
-Here's good.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.107
Sandy and Chunky,
you stand watch.

00:00:37.281 --> 00:00:38.413
[roars]

00:00:38.587 --> 00:00:40.023
Ugga and I will forage.

00:00:40.197 --> 00:00:42.591
Guy and Eep? Guy and Eep?

00:00:42.765 --> 00:00:44.201
Guy and Eep?!

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:45.376
-EEP: Boop.
-GUY: Boop.

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:46.899
-[giggles] Boop.
-[chuckles] Boop.

00:00:47.073 --> 00:00:47.944
-Boop.
-Boop.

00:00:48.118 --> 00:00:49.424
Hello! Hey!

00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:51.121
You're in charge of the fire.

00:00:51.295 --> 00:00:53.776
-No problem, Dad.
-You can count on us, Dad.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:55.125
Don't call me that!

00:00:55.299 --> 00:00:56.561
["True" by Spandau Ballet
playing]

00:00:56.735 --> 00:00:59.085
-Hey.
-"Hey" what?

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:00.391
Hey, you.

00:01:00.565 --> 00:01:02.132
"Hey, you" back. [laughs]

00:01:02.306 --> 00:01:04.613
Uh-uh.
I "Hey, you'd" first.

00:01:04.787 --> 00:01:06.136
And I'm "hey-ing" you
right back.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:08.268
-[Thunk groans]
-[Eep laughs]

00:01:09.748 --> 00:01:11.141
[chuckling]:
Look at them.

00:01:11.315 --> 00:01:13.012
Guy used to have so many ideas.

00:01:13.186 --> 00:01:15.711
I mean... I mean, wasn't he
the one that gave us fire?

00:01:15.885 --> 00:01:17.321
[chuckles]

00:01:17.495 --> 00:01:18.757
Now he's useless.

00:01:18.931 --> 00:01:20.759
Th-They'd never survive
on their own.

00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:22.587
[groans]:
Hungry.

00:01:22.761 --> 00:01:25.721
I know, Thunk, and we'll eat
our ration of dry twigs

00:01:25.895 --> 00:01:29.072
and bitter roots just as soon
as two pack members,

00:01:29.246 --> 00:01:33.293
who shall remain nameless, do
their jobs and start the fire!

00:01:33.468 --> 00:01:35.426
Come on, man.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.732
Just chill.

00:01:36.906 --> 00:01:39.996
No, you "come on, man"!

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:41.563
-I'm gonna chill your a...
-Grug. Hey, hey, hey, Grug.

00:01:41.737 --> 00:01:43.042
-Easy.
-[panting]

00:01:43.216 --> 00:01:44.827
Calm down, big guy.

00:01:45.001 --> 00:01:47.264
[grunts angrily]

00:01:47.438 --> 00:01:50.702
You know, Grug,
eventually, Eep and Guy,

00:01:50.876 --> 00:01:52.791
they're gonna want to start
their own pack,

00:01:52.965 --> 00:01:54.445
just like we did.

00:01:54.619 --> 00:01:56.795
-It's our nature.
-[laughs]: No way.

00:01:56.969 --> 00:01:57.970
Not happening.

00:01:58.144 --> 00:02:00.320
The pack is stronger together.

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:01.844
-Yes!
-[chuckles]

00:02:02.018 --> 00:02:03.715
You did it! [laughs]

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:05.848
Eep would never leave us.

00:02:06.022 --> 00:02:08.720
[chuckling]: No.
Like Eep would ever-- Come on.

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:11.897
[scoffing]

00:02:12.071 --> 00:02:14.073
[all snoring]

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.557
[Guy groans]

00:02:19.731 --> 00:02:21.124
No. No.

00:02:21.298 --> 00:02:23.474
[yawns] Pack stays together.

00:02:23.648 --> 00:02:24.736
Pack stays together.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.346
-[grunts, groans]
-Pack stays together.

00:02:26.521 --> 00:02:28.348
[all groaning]

00:02:28.523 --> 00:02:30.699
[grunting]

00:02:30.873 --> 00:02:33.571
-[snoring continues]
-[Guy groans]

00:02:33.745 --> 00:02:34.877
Eep.

00:02:35.051 --> 00:02:36.226
Eep, are you awake?

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.532
EEP:
Yeah.

00:02:37.706 --> 00:02:39.055
Hold on. I'm coming over.

00:02:39.229 --> 00:02:40.099
[grunting]

00:02:40.273 --> 00:02:41.144
[gasps]

00:02:41.318 --> 00:02:42.406
Oh.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:43.625
Hey, Gran.

00:02:44.669 --> 00:02:46.453
[snoring loudly]

00:02:48.412 --> 00:02:49.587
[snoring stops]

00:02:49.761 --> 00:02:51.023
-[snoring loudly]
-[shudders]

00:02:51.197 --> 00:02:52.329
Oh!

00:02:52.503 --> 00:02:54.287
[grunting]

00:02:54.461 --> 00:02:55.375
[tumbling]

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.334
[gasps, sighs]

00:02:57.508 --> 00:02:58.814
-Hi.
-Hi.

00:02:58.988 --> 00:02:59.815
[snoring continues]

00:02:59.989 --> 00:03:00.903
Can he hear us?

00:03:01.077 --> 00:03:02.600
Nah. Once he's out, he's out.

00:03:02.774 --> 00:03:03.775
Oh.

00:03:03.949 --> 00:03:05.777
-Hey.
-Hey.

00:03:05.951 --> 00:03:06.952
No, no.

00:03:07.126 --> 00:03:08.693
This is a-a "hey"
with a question.

00:03:08.867 --> 00:03:12.654
Um, so, uh, I was thinking...

00:03:12.828 --> 00:03:14.481
-Mm...
-That's not my hand.

00:03:17.354 --> 00:03:18.964
Anyway, uh...

00:03:19.138 --> 00:03:20.749
I couldn't sleep.

00:03:20.923 --> 00:03:21.880
I was thinking about Tomorrow.

00:03:22.054 --> 00:03:23.882
Our Tomorrow.

00:03:24.056 --> 00:03:26.145
Our Tomorrow?
What do you mean?

00:03:26.319 --> 00:03:29.105
What I mean is, um,
maybe our Tomorrow

00:03:29.279 --> 00:03:33.457
is different than
the rest of... of the pack's.

00:03:33.631 --> 00:03:36.329
Maybe our Tomorrow is
a place of our own, you know?

00:03:36.503 --> 00:03:40.464
Like a, like a home,
just the-the two of us.

00:03:40.638 --> 00:03:43.467
Just the two of us? Huh.

00:03:43.641 --> 00:03:46.078
Guy, I'd really miss my family.

00:03:47.906 --> 00:03:49.952
But that does sound amazing.

00:03:50.126 --> 00:03:51.431
A place of our own?

00:03:51.606 --> 00:03:53.042
Our home?

00:03:53.216 --> 00:03:54.173
Ooh!

00:03:54.347 --> 00:03:55.522
Can our home have flowers?

00:03:55.697 --> 00:03:57.220
Sure can. And butterflies.

00:03:57.394 --> 00:03:58.656
And a sweet babbling brook?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.615
And privacy.

00:04:00.789 --> 00:04:02.834
Ooh! What's "privacy"?

00:04:03.008 --> 00:04:05.707
It means you only smell
the feet you want to smell.

00:04:05.881 --> 00:04:06.708
Wow.

00:04:06.882 --> 00:04:09.754
So, um...

00:04:09.928 --> 00:04:13.149
do you, Eep Amber Crood,

00:04:13.323 --> 00:04:16.500
think you could spend
your Tomorrow with me?

00:04:16.674 --> 00:04:17.893
[gasps]

00:04:19.895 --> 00:04:21.244
I do.

00:04:21.418 --> 00:04:24.421
-[snoring continues]
-[stomach gurgling]

00:04:24.595 --> 00:04:28.033
I'm going to fall asleep
and dream about our home.

00:04:28.207 --> 00:04:30.557
-Good night, Guy.
-Good night, Eep.

00:04:32.821 --> 00:04:35.084
Just the two of them?

00:04:38.435 --> 00:04:41.307
Warping my baby's mind
with whispers and kisses.

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:43.832
"Can Grug hear us?"
Oh, yeah, Grug hears.

00:04:44.006 --> 00:04:45.572
Grug hears all.

00:04:45.747 --> 00:04:47.879
All about your private
two-person house of Tomorrow,

00:04:48.053 --> 00:04:50.969
whispering, kissing,
butter-babble-brooking.

00:04:51.143 --> 00:04:53.580
What the heck is that?!

00:04:53.755 --> 00:04:55.757
[all snoring]

00:04:56.975 --> 00:04:58.977
[stomach gurgling repeatedly]

00:05:01.023 --> 00:05:03.939
[groaning]:
Thunk, make it stop.

00:05:04.113 --> 00:05:06.158
-[repeated gurgling continues]
-Hit snooze.

00:05:06.332 --> 00:05:07.507
Stop it, tummy.

00:05:07.682 --> 00:05:10.206
[Chunky yawning]

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.077
Another glorious morning.
[grunts]

00:05:12.251 --> 00:05:14.297
-What's that? You want to play?
-[panting]

00:05:14.471 --> 00:05:16.081
Go get it, boy! No, Sandy!

00:05:16.255 --> 00:05:17.561
Mom!

00:05:17.735 --> 00:05:19.955
Sandy's fetching
Douglas's stick again.

00:05:20.129 --> 00:05:22.566
-[trees rustle]
-[Douglas barking]

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.481
-Uh, what's that?
-[heavy footsteps approaching]

00:05:24.655 --> 00:05:26.352
-[growls]
-Kill circle.

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:29.573
[all grunting]

00:05:31.009 --> 00:05:32.489
[Chunky growls]

00:05:32.663 --> 00:05:34.056
Safety off, babe.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.710
Thanks.

00:05:39.626 --> 00:05:42.238
Today is a good day to die!

00:05:43.326 --> 00:05:45.676
Hey, everyone! You'll never
guess what I fou-- Ow!

00:05:47.417 --> 00:05:48.897
Oops. Sorry, honey.
[chuckles]

00:05:49.071 --> 00:05:50.899
We thought you were a predator
trying to kill us.

00:05:51.073 --> 00:05:53.336
No, never apologize for
an effective kill circle.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.120
You have to come see this.
Follow me.

00:05:55.294 --> 00:05:56.252
Come on. This way.

00:05:56.426 --> 00:05:57.427
[whoops]

00:05:57.601 --> 00:05:59.385
Yes! You're gonna love it!

00:05:59.559 --> 00:06:01.300
-[Grug laughs]
-[Chunky growls softly]

00:06:06.088 --> 00:06:08.481
-Wow.
-Whoa.

00:06:08.655 --> 00:06:10.396
♪ ♪

